rategies/chains, reported by an oracle"},"deprecated_lastBlockUpdated":{"details":"the last block number when the aggregated underlying balances were updated"},"deprecated_lastPricePerShare":{"details":"the last price per share calculated after the aggregated underlying balances are reported"},"deprecated_maxPercentageChange":{"details":"the maximum percentage change allowed before the vault is paused. It can be updated by the owner. 1e18 = 100%. It's value depends on the frequency of the oracle updates."},"feeOnDeposit":{"details":"the fee charged for the deposits, it's a percentage of the assets deposited"},"feeOnWithdraw":{"details":"the fee charged for the withdraws, it's a percentage of the assets redeemed"},"feeRecipient":{"details":"the address that receives the fees for the vault operations, if it's zero, no fees are charged"},"totalPendingAssets":{"details":"the total amount of assets that are pending redemption"}},"title":"yoUSDT - Yo Protocol extension for USDT. 95% of the funds are relayed to yoUSD on deposit. The remaining 5% is used for instant redemption. yoUSDT shares the same oracle as yoUSD, which means that the price of yoUSDT is the same as the price of yoUSD.","version":1},"userdoc":{"errors":{"InsufficientShares()":[{"notice":"Thrown when insufficient shares balance is available to complete the operation."}],"InvalidAssetsAmount()":[{"notice":"Thrown when a withdraw is attempted with an amount different than the claimable assets."}],"InvalidFee()":[{"notice":"Thrown when the new fee is greater than the max allowed fee."}],"InvalidPrice()":[{"notice":"Thrown when the price is zero"}],"InvalidSharesAmount()":[{"notice":"Thrown when a claim request is fulfilled with an invalid shares amount."}],"NotSharesOwner()":[{"notice":"Thrown when the operation is called by a user that is not the owner of the shares."}],"SharesAmountZero()":[{"notice":"Thrown when the input shares amount is zero."}],"TargetMethodNotAuthorized(address,bytes4)":[{"notice":"Thrown when an unauthorized method to a target is called."}],"UseRequestRedeem()":[{"notice":"Thrown when redeem() or withdraw() is called"}],"ZeroReceiver()":[{"notice":"Thrown when the receiver is zero"}]},"events":{"DepositFeeUpdated(uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"Emitted when the fee is updated"},"FeeRecipientUpdated(address,address)":{"notice":"Emitted when the fee recipient is updated"},"MaxPercentageUpdated(uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"Emitted when the max percentage is updated"},"Received(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Emitted when the contract receives ether"},"RedeemRequest(address,address,uint256,uint256,bool)":{"notice":"Emitted when a new redeem request is created"},"RequestCancelled(address,uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"Emitted when a redeem request is cancelled"},"RequestFulfilled(address,uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"Emitted when a redeem request is fulfilled"},"UnderlyingBalanceUpdated(uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"Emitted when the underlying balance is updated by the oracle"},"WithdrawFeeUpdated(uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"Emitted when the fee is updated"}},"kind":"user","methods":{"cancelRedeem(address,uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"The operator can cancel a redeem request in case of an black swan event."},"fulfillRedeem(address,uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"The operator can fulfill a redeem request. Requires authorization."},"getImplementation()":{"notice":"Get the implementation contract address of a proxy."},"lastPricePerShare()":{"notice":"Get the last price per share from the oracle."},"manage(address,bytes,uint256)":{"notice":"Allows the vault operator to manage the vault."},"manage(address[],bytes[],uint256[])":{"notice":"Same as `manage` but allows for multiple calls in a single transaction."},"pause()":{"notice":"Pause the contract to prevent any further deposits, withdrawals, or transfers."},"pendingRedeemRequest(address)":{"notice":"Get the amount of assets and shares that are pending redemption."},"requestRedeem(uint256,address,address)":{"notice":"If the vault has enough assets to fulfill the request, withdraw the assets and return them to the owner. Otherwise, transfer the shares to the vault and store the request. The shares are burned when the request is fulfilled and the assets are transferred to the owner."},"unpause()":{"notice":"Unpause the contract to allow deposits, withdrawals, and transfers."},"updateDepositFee(uint256)":{"notice":"Update the fee charged for the vault operations."},"updateFeeRecipient(address)":{"notice":"Update the address that receives the fees for the vault operations."},"updateWithdrawFee(uint256)":{"notice":"Update the fee charged for the vault operations."},"withdraw(uint256,address,address)":{"notice":"This method is disabled. Use `requestRedeem` or `redeem`instead."}},"version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"src/yoUSDT.sol":"yoUSDT"},"evmVersion":"shanghai","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"none"},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":1000},"remappings":[":@openzeppelin/contracts-upgradeable/=node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts-upgradeable/",":@openzeppelin/contracts/=node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/",":@solmate/=node_modules/solmate/src/",":forge-std/=node_modules/forge-std/src/",":solmate/=node_modules/solmate/"]},"sources":{"node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts-upgradeable/proxy/utils/Initializable.sol":{"keccak256":"0x631188737069917d2f909d29ce62c4d48611d326686ba6683e26b72a23bfac0b","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://7a61054ae84cd6c4d04c0c4450ba1d6de41e27e0a2c4f1bcdf58f796b401c609","dweb:/ipfs/QmUvtdp7X1mRVyC3CsHrtPbgoqWaXHp3S1ZR24tpAQYJWM"]},"node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts-upgradeable/token/ERC20/ERC20Upgradeable.sol":{"keccak256":"0x5c54228bbb2f1f8616179c51bdb90b7960f4a3414c390ad5c6ead6763eb55a59","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://745fe72596bb8fde5f294d9d6b943db942202e4445536ee00da3ba011f876e86","dweb:/ipfs/QmcjeESkk4rbhUVaSBfyq5f8rY56Jms1TwcJXaRD55K3UH"]},"node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts-upgradeable/token/ERC20/extensions/ERC4626Upgra